#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" realizes that this roll of toilet paper is a treasure that must not be "
"given away."
msgstr "은(는) 이 휴지 한 롤이 절대 남에게 줄 수 없는 보물이라는 걸 깨닫는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "The team decides to try to share the roll of toilet paper."
msgstr "일행은 휴지 한 롤을 나눠 쓰기로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"It doesn't take them long to be erupt into a huge fight! The situation "
"descends into an all-out brawl. The toilet paper ends up getting torn apart "
"by accident!"
msgstr "금세 큰 싸움이 벌어진다! 상황은 난투극으로 번진다. 휴지는 실수로 찢어져 버린다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"There's some inevitable fighting from having to share the TP, but the group "
"manages to overcome their differences."
msgstr "휴지를 나눠 쓰다 보니 다툼이 좀 있었지만, 일행은 차이를 극복한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"The group joins forces around the toilet paper, mutually protecting it. Even"
" after the TP is gone, the cardboard tube becomes a symbol for the group's "
"unity."
msgstr "일행은 휴지를 중심으로 힘을 합쳐 서로 지킨다. 휴지가 다 떨어진 뒤에도 그 심지는 일행의 단결을 상징하게 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" decides to sell the roll of toilet paper as soon as possible. It's not "
"worth carrying something THAT valuable around!"
msgstr "은(는) 휴지를 최대한 빨리 팔기로 한다. 그렇게 귀한 걸 들고 다닐 순 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "A settlement buys the roll of TP for 20 food! Not bad!"
msgstr "한 정착지가 휴지를 식량 20에 산다! 나쁘지 않다!"

